# Internal F5 communications.
#
# Internal announcements, maintenance notices, program emails and leadership
# decks are not public and are not needed to build or run the binary. Keep
# them locally if they are useful as working context, but do not publish
# them here — this repository is INTERNAL, not private, and unannounced
# platform migrations, programme names and staff contact details should not
# be redistributed through it.
#
# Public F5 knowledge base articles (docs/K*.txt) are deliberately NOT
# ignored: they are already published, and archiving them makes the
# citations in this repository checkable.
docs/ESDP_CUTOVER_NOTICES_*.txt
docs/*INTERNAL*
docs/*_NOTICES_*.txt
docs/*.eml
docs/*.msg
docs/*.pptx

